OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of shopping
OL,4,Aprecinct killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been convicted of
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after carrying out a
OL,8,Fserious assault on his victim outside a
OL,9,Frow of shops in a town centre.
OL,11,FAndrew Allen, 55, of Severn Road, in
OL,12,FBury St Edmunds, Suffolk, attacked
OL,13,FScott Lisney, 56, also from the town,
OL,14,Fat the St Olaves shopping precinct on
OL,15,F26 July 2025.
OL,17,FAllen was initially charged with
OL,18,Finflicting grievous bodily harm, but
OL,19,Fthe charge was changed to manslaughter
OL,20,Fafter Lisney died of his injuries in
OL,21,Fthe West Suffolk Hospital three days
OL,22,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
