OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of shopping
OL,4,Aprecinct killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a trial at Peterborough Crown
OL,7,FCourt, a jury returned a unanimous
OL,8,Fguilty verdict before Allen, who
OL,9,Fremains on bail, was told he would be
OL,10,Fsentenced on Friday.
